Here is the commit message:
Instructor Detail: Class Assignments

- fixed an ArrayIndexOutOfBoundsException thrown when the instructor is assigned to one or more classes, but there is no committed timetable yet
- the problem has been introduced by a recent change (commit cef4170, added Responsibility column)
- this fixes issue #27

Here is the root cause:
The bug was caused by an `ArrayIndexOutOfBoundsException` due to the addition of a new "Responsibility" column in the table layout without updating the corresponding array of column alignment strings. The array did not account for the extra column, leading to an attempt to access an index that did not exist when rendering the table for instructors assigned to classes without a committed timetable.

